---
import Base from '../layouts/Base.astro';
---
<Base title="About" description="About Pranamya's Disclosures and how to report or request coordinated disclosure.">
  <h1 class="page-title">About</h1>
  <p class="page-lede">Security research by Pranamya Keshkamat, with a focus on smart contracts and EVM protocols.</p>

  <div class="prose">
    <h2>Disclosure policy</h2>
    <p>
      Every finding published here followed coordinated disclosure: the affected party was
      contacted privately first, given time to remediate, and the writeup went public only
      after a fix shipped or an agreed disclosure window elapsed.
    </p>
    <p>
      Proof-of-concept code is published for reproducibility and defensive review. It targets
      versions that are already patched.
    </p>

    <h2>Contact</h2>
    <p>
      For coordinated disclosure or research inquiries, reach me on
      <a href="https://github.com/pranamya55" rel="noopener noreferrer">GitHub</a>.
    </p>
  </div>
</Base>
